<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Chopin completed the 56 doses of the intensive phase yesterday, all observed by video within eight weeks, and pyrazinamide has stopped; from today he takes rifapentine, moxifloxacin, isoniazid, and pyridoxine for nine more weeks. The isolate is susceptible to rifampin, isoniazid, pyrazinamide, and moxifloxacin. The cultures from the third week show no growth at six weeks. His cough has gone except for a little phlegm on waking, and he has gained 3.5 kg since diagnosis. He has no tendon pain, tingling, yellowing, or rash. He is teaching twelve students a week and has told them about his illness; none has left. The health department tells him the investigation of his contacts is going well, without giving him details. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Treatment</td><td>56 of 56 intensive-phase doses observed; continuation phase from today</td></tr><tr><td>Susceptibility</td><td>Susceptible to rifampin, isoniazid, pyrazinamide, and moxifloxacin</td></tr><tr><td>Cultures</td><td>Third-week cultures negative at six weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>52.0 kg, up 3.5 kg</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

